<title>USA: Little Falls stake cut by Bay Pond.</title>
<headline>Little Falls stake cut by Bay Pond.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bay Pond Partners LP said Thursday it cut its stake in Little Falls Bancorp Inc to 169,100 common shares or 5.56 percent from 6.57 percent held previously.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Bay Pond said it sold 38,900 common shares on Oct 28 at a price of $11.50 per share.</p>
<p>Bay Pond said they continue to hold remaining stake for investment purposes.</p>
